  "reflectionText": "The priests stepped into the Jordan at flood, and the water from above stood still. They stood firm with the ark in the middle of the river bed while the people passed over. What is it to be the ones whose feet have to enter the water before the river will hold still — and to stand in the bed of it while everyone you have been leading walks past you where the river had been?",
